  "summary": "Malicious code in @onereach/expression-components (npm)",
  "details": "The package's preinstall hook (setup.mjs) downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime from github[.]com/oven-sh/bun/releases and executes a bundled 727KB script (math_init.js) with it during installation. math_init.js is heavily obfuscated with a custom string-table encoding, making its runtime behavior opaque; it is executed automatically on install with no opt-in. No plaintext C2/exfil endpoint was observed in the readable portion of the package.",
